sequenceDiagram
    title BLE GATT Indication Flow: Enable, Receive, Acknowledge

    participant App as App<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GattClient]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer / ATT events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through Echo callbacks.

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 1. Discover CCCD for target characteristic
        App->>Node: GattClient.StartDescriptorDiscovery(<br>startHandle=0x0035, endHandle=0x0038)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_FIND_INFORMATION_RSP entries
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.DescriptorDiscovered(<br>uuid=0x2902, handle=0x0036)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.DescriptorDiscoveryComplete(success)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 2. Enable indications (not notifications)
        App->>Node: GattClient.WriteDescriptor(<br>handle=0x0036, data=0x0200)
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_WRITE_REQ (handle=0x0036, value=0x0200)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_WRITE_RSP
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 3. Receive and acknowledge indications
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_HANDLE_VALUE_IND (handle=0x0035, value=0x64)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.IndicationReceived(<br>handle=0x0035, data=0x64)
        App->>Node: GattClient.IndicationDone()
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_HANDLE_VALUE_CFM
        Note right of App: The peripheral will not send the next indication<br>until it receives ATT_HANDLE_VALUE_CFM.

        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_HANDLE_VALUE_IND (handle=0x0035, value=0x65)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.IndicationReceived(<br>handle=0x0035, data=0x65)
        App->>Node: GattClient.IndicationDone()
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_HANDLE_VALUE_CFM
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 4. Disable indications
        App->>Node: GattClient.WriteDescriptor(<br>handle=0x0036, data=0x0000)
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_WRITE_REQ (handle=0x0036, value=0x0000)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_WRITE_RSP
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
    end
